Axis under review: Design
Review feedback output: /state/feat-x/run-1/phase-2/implement/iteration-01/review/design/review-feedback.md

Required sections in `review-feedback.md` (in this exact order):
1. `## Findings` — severity-prefixed bullets or `- (none)`
2. `## Suggestions` — non-blocking improvements or `- (none)`
3. `## Review Scope` — scope token (`targeted` or `full`) on its own line, followed by a non-empty justification
4. `## Verdict` — exactly `APPROVED` or `CHANGES_REQUESTED`

